}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Get TACOTS Onboarding Detail
  
  Retrieves the full detail of a single TACOTS onboarding record by its unique identifier. Returns all mental-health screening, physical-health, enrolled school, commitment, and file URL fields.
  
  ## Authorization
  Requires `read` permission.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  
  | Parameter | Type   | Required | Description                            |
  |-----------|--------|----------|----------------------------------------|
  | id        | string | Yes      | UUID of the TACOTS onboarding record   |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`200 OK`** — Returns the complete TACOTS onboarding record including all uploaded file URLs.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "...",
    "data": { ... }
  }
  ```
  
  ### Response Fields (`data`)
  
  | Field                        | Type     | Description                                                        |
  |------------------------------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | id                           | string   | UUID primary key.                                                  |
  | studentId                    | string   | UUID reference to the TACOTS recommendation record.                |
  | onboardingDate               | string   | Date of onboarding (`YYYY-MM-DD`).                                 |
  | hasMentalHealthDiagnosis     | string   | Whether the student has a mental health diagnosis.                 |
  | diagnosedConditions          | string[] | Diagnosed mental health conditions (nullable).                     |
  | behavioralIndicators         | string[] | Observed behavioural indicators.                                   |
  | focusAbilityRating           | number   | Focus ability rating (1–5).                                        |
  | emotionalStabilityRating     | number   | Emotional stability rating (1–5).                                  |
  | peerInteractionRating        | number   | Peer interaction rating (1–5).                                     |
  | receivedCounseling           | string   | Whether the student has received counseling.                       |
  | needsSpecialSupport          | string   | Whether the student needs special support.                         |
  | mentalHealthNotes            | string   | Additional mental health notes (nullable).                         |
  | generalHealthStatus          | string   | General health status.                                             |
  | immunizationStatus           | string   | Immunization status.                                               |
  | hasChronicCondition          | string   | Whether the student has a chronic condition.                       |
  | chronicConditions            | string[] | Chronic conditions (nullable).                                     |
  | allergies                    | string[] | Known allergies.                                                   |
  | requiresMedication           | string   | Whether the student requires regular medication.                   |
  | physicalActivityLevel        | number   | Physical activity level rating (1–5).                              |
  | physicalLimitations          | string   | Physical limitations description.                                  |
  | additionalHealthNotes        | string   | Additional health notes (nullable).                                |
  | enrolledSchoolName           | string   | Name of the enrolled school.                                       |
  | enrolledSchoolTown           | string   | Town of the enrolled school.                                       |
  | enrolledSchoolLga            | string   | LGA of the enrolled school.                                        |
  | enrolledSchoolState          | string   | State of the enrolled school.                                      |
  | enrolledClass                | string   | Class the student is enrolled in.                                  |
  | termResumptionDate           | string   | Term resumption date (`YYYY-MM-DD`).                               |
  | schoolFeesPerTerm            | number   | School fees per term (nullable).                                   |
  | studentCommitment            | boolean  | Whether the student signed the commitment (nullable).              |
  | parentGuardianCommitment     | boolean  | Whether the parent/guardian signed the commitment.                 |
  | parentSignatureUrl           | string   | URL of the parent signature image (nullable).                      |
  | parentSignaturePublicId      | string   | Cloudinary public ID for the parent signature (nullable).          |
  | admissionLetterUrl           | string   | URL of the admission letter (nullable).                            |
  | admissionLetterPublicId      | string   | Cloudinary public ID for the admission letter (nullable).          |
  | programOfficerNotes          | string   | Notes from the programme officer (nullable).                       |
  | supportTypesApproved         | string[] | Approved support types (nullable).                                 |
  | mentorName                   | string   | Name of the assigned mentor (nullable).                            |
  | sponsorName                  | string   | Name of the sponsor (nullable).                                    |
  | additionalInfo               | string   | Additional information (nullable).                                 |
  | updatedAt                    | string   | ISO 8601 timestamp of last update (nullable).                      |
  | createdAt                    | string   | ISO 8601 timestamp of record creation.                             |
  | deletedAt                    | string   | ISO 8601 soft-delete timestamp (nullable).                         |
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                             |
  |-----------------------------|---------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Invalid `id` format (must be a valid UUID).              |
  | `401 Unauthorized`          | Missing or invalid authentication token.                |
  | `403 Forbidden`             | User does not have `read` permission.                   |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Unexpected server error.                                |
}
